A variadic method: the slice argument is forwarded with the ... spread, and the
pointer receiver is satisfied by a value provider coerced with &. This exercises the
method path of the variadic render together with the value→pointer receiver
bridge ((&builder).Make(options...)).
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
output: plumb_gen.go
-- example.com/app/app.go --
package app

type Option struct{}
type Server struct{}
type Builder struct{}

//plumb:build
var DefaultBuilder = Builder{}

//plumb:build
func Options() []Option { return nil }

//plumb:build
func (b *Builder) Make(opts ...Option) *Server { return &Server{} }
